<title>EGYPT: Egypt, Israel talks on Mideast peace crisis end.</title>
<headline>Egypt, Israel talks on Mideast peace crisis end.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Egyptian President Hosni Mubarak and Israeli Prime Minister Benjamin Netanyahu ended a three-hour meeting on Tuesday aimed at reviving the Middle East peace talks snagged on differences over Jewish settlements.</p>
<p>Mubarak and Netanyahu met at a luxury hotel in the Egyptian Red Sea resort of Sharm el-Sheikh.</p>
